Two important recon datapoints:

1. **Front-end gateway** `smartfarming.suedzuckergroup.com/mdp-api/v3/api/...` returns `400 Missing X-Selected-Partner-Link-Id header`. This is notable: the API gateway requires a **`X-Selected-Partner-Link-Id` header** — a header that selects which partner/organization the request acts on. This is EXACTLY the "switchToPartnerNumber"-style BOLA surface: a client-supplied partner-scoping header. If the backend trusts this header to determine tenant scope without cross-checking it against the JWT's own organization membership, that's a cross-tenant BOLA. High-value signal.

